**`src/OpenSolarMax.Mods.S2/Systems/Simulate/TeamReference/SynchronizeTeamSystem.cs`** — SynchronizeTeamSystem(class), _parentsDesc(constant), SyncToChildren(method), Update(method), OpenSolarMax.Mods.S2.Systems(namespace)

